      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Automatic (X)" id="2be1-10ec-7e7f-a911" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="321d-91fa-c981-2ce1"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Casganarwyn" id="2f39-ed25-7863-30af" hidden="false">
          <description>After deploying the Casganarwyn sets their Inspiring Presence level by rolling a d3. The result of the roll is their Level in the Ability until the unit chooses to spend an Activation to roll again.

Level 1 – Rhyflers within 3” may perform a free Steady Task this round.
Level 2 – Rhyflers within 5” gain +1 Movement Allowance until the beginning of their commander’s next round.
Level 3 – Rhyflers within 3” Gain +1 Sk until the beginning of the commander’s next round.

After a rhyfler makes use of an Inspiring Presence bonus they must then roll on the In Their Cups! chart to see if their indulgence has an effect on future performance upon the battlefield. The bonus chosen must be equal to or lower than the Level rolled.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
